WEBVTT

00:12.950 --> 00:13.780
Hold on!

00:13.780 --> 00:16.200
Idiot, your wound!

00:21.250 --> 00:22.960
It's finally gone.

00:22.960 --> 00:23.670
Yeah.

00:24.460 --> 00:26.000
Wait, your wound!

00:38.970 --> 00:41.890
You are the children of sin.

00:41.890 --> 00:44.100
Everything is your fault.

00:44.600 --> 00:49.820
I'm so happy that I can finally express my thoughts openly.

00:49.820 --> 00:52.900
Especially this grudge that can never be quelled.

01:04.210 --> 01:06.750
I remember you now, Tsugumi.

01:06.750 --> 01:09.500
It's true that we all left this place without telling you.

01:09.960 --> 01:13.550
But seeking revenge like this is a mistake!

01:13.550 --> 01:15.090
Mistake, you say?

01:15.090 --> 01:16.220
That's right.

01:16.220 --> 01:19.550
Even something like this can't possibly lift a grudge!

01:26.350 --> 01:27.900
You're right.

01:27.900 --> 01:31.440
This isn't nearly enough to clear my mind of it.

01:36.030 --> 01:38.530
The Corpse will revive soon.

01:39.160 --> 01:42.370
When that happens,
judgment will befall everyone.

01:44.330 --> 01:46.080
And this time, you won't get away.

02:24.700 --> 02:33.040
The ink on today's graffiti runs

02:33.040 --> 02:44.060
A bicycle that has been abandoned awaits someone's return

02:44.060 --> 02:55.020
When we realized, it was up for us to choose if our existence is a replica or not

02:55.020 --> 02:59.400
Where is our proof?

02:59.400 --> 03:04.490
It's mankinds nature to come together

03:04.490 --> 03:09.540
Our love and bonds are things we can trust

03:09.540 --> 03:14.340
My sins are to be doubted

03:14.340 --> 03:20.680
The light I saw when you first held out your right hand

03:24.050 --> 03:29.520
We really are

03:38.030 --> 03:40.240
The Dark Metal

03:44.450 --> 03:48.540
Episode 17
Light of the Lightless

03:54.080 --> 03:57.090
I didn't think you'd cry over me.

04:01.420 --> 04:03.890
Be a little more gentle.

04:03.890 --> 04:05.970
Like how you would treat the one you love—

04:07.640 --> 04:11.140
You embraced me earlier so gently, so—

04:12.600 --> 04:13.640
Yes.

04:13.640 --> 04:15.230
Understood.

04:15.230 --> 04:16.480
Linking data now.

04:16.480 --> 04:17.730
Oh, Suzaki-san.

04:18.150 --> 04:19.190
What's wrong?

04:19.190 --> 04:25.200
An SDF plane managed to obtain the Sable's
and Guelue's signal above the Lightless Realm.

04:25.200 --> 04:26.200
What about the Argent?

04:26.570 --> 04:31.000
It's still maintaining silence for now.

04:31.000 --> 04:31.790
I see.

04:40.840 --> 04:42.220
What is that?

04:42.880 --> 04:45.130
Is it possible that it's the Corpse?

04:46.800 --> 04:48.640
The signal has disappeared again.

04:48.640 --> 04:52.390
Tell them to be careful and not to
get too close to the Lightless Realm.

04:58.560 --> 04:59.980
Emergency call from the patrol plane!

04:59.980 --> 05:01.980
They say they're making an emergency landing at Atsugi!

05:11.790 --> 05:13.750
That was some amazing malice.

05:13.750 --> 05:15.460
We couldn't do anything about it!

05:16.040 --> 05:17.250
Know that I, too—

05:24.760 --> 05:28.510
Well, I guess this is punishment for burning down precious samples.

05:28.510 --> 05:29.640
It can't be helped.

05:30.470 --> 05:32.140
Ten years, huh?

05:32.140 --> 05:34.640
It took even longer than I thought it would.

05:37.520 --> 05:42.480
Scattered into ashes, here, Garon...

05:54.950 --> 05:56.540
Make it stop!

05:56.910 --> 05:58.750
The Corpse is furious.

05:59.330 --> 06:01.420
Even I can't stop it now.

06:18.020 --> 06:20.480
Minashi, what're you doing?!

06:20.480 --> 06:24.730
Minashi and Sasame both know the
weight of the sins they've committed.

06:25.400 --> 06:28.110
That's why they can't fight back.

06:32.740 --> 06:36.750
No... No... No... No...

06:37.080 --> 06:38.750
I don't want it to be like this!

06:42.790 --> 06:44.340
Isn't that right, Emiru?

06:51.550 --> 06:52.050
Mahmu!

07:09.700 --> 07:11.660
Everyone, please escape.

07:11.990 --> 07:13.200
Minashi...

07:14.120 --> 07:17.830
Th-This is Sasame's and my sins.

07:19.620 --> 07:21.080
That's right.

07:21.080 --> 07:24.710
Not only did you two leave me behind,

07:24.710 --> 07:27.250
but you took Akashi from me as well.

07:28.880 --> 07:34.390
Sasame fell in love with you
and took you away from me.

07:35.350 --> 07:36.470
Isn't that horrible?

07:43.980 --> 07:45.060
This is pretty.

07:45.060 --> 07:45.940
Yup.

07:57.950 --> 07:59.500
You're wrong.

07:59.500 --> 08:00.580
Akashi?

08:01.290 --> 08:02.750
You're wrong.

08:02.750 --> 08:04.960
Sasame would never do something like that!

08:17.640 --> 08:18.890
Sasame!

08:22.980 --> 08:25.020
Th-That's how it should be.

08:25.020 --> 08:26.150
Run, Akashi.

08:26.650 --> 08:28.480
Making sure you return back alive...

08:28.480 --> 08:29.150
That's...

08:30.320 --> 08:34.610
...the promise I made to Sasame.

08:36.700 --> 08:39.580
Akashi, you shouldn't run.

08:39.580 --> 08:42.620
You can't possibly get out of here by yourself.

08:43.660 --> 08:45.920
You'll get lost again.

08:46.920 --> 08:48.880
But don't worry.

08:48.880 --> 08:51.090
I'll discipline all these kids.

08:51.090 --> 08:53.720
And when the Corpse's anger has subsided,

08:54.050 --> 08:57.140
I'll properly catch you.

08:58.800 --> 09:00.060
The Reaper...

09:00.060 --> 09:02.390
I have to find the Reaper!

09:02.390 --> 09:03.680
Where did I leave it?

09:21.410 --> 09:23.580
She's going into the Lightless Realm?

09:23.950 --> 09:24.790
Yes.

09:24.790 --> 09:26.960
She told me to support her from over here.

09:29.630 --> 09:30.590
Susan!

09:31.130 --> 09:33.760
Can you stop calling me that in public?

09:34.090 --> 09:35.300
It's too risky.

09:35.300 --> 09:37.380
Even if your psyche could bear it,

09:37.380 --> 09:40.470
you'd last an hour at most in that car and suit.

09:40.470 --> 09:44.230
There's also a risk of Nectrometal infecting you.

09:44.230 --> 09:45.730
One hour?

09:45.730 --> 09:46.850
I'll be sure to remember that.

09:47.480 --> 09:48.810
You really are serious...

09:48.810 --> 09:53.530
It's the last resort, but I want to know what's happening inside there.

09:53.780 --> 09:55.110
All right.

09:55.110 --> 09:56.400
Don't be reckless.

09:56.700 --> 09:57.990
Of course.

09:57.990 --> 10:01.620
It'd be better to take us linkers, Suzaki-san.

10:01.950 --> 10:04.080
Iwato, how are your wounds?

10:04.330 --> 10:05.830
Nothing to worry about.

10:05.830 --> 10:08.330
All thanks to the loving care I received.

10:09.170 --> 10:10.750
Thank you.

10:17.420 --> 10:20.850
I'm sure the Reaper's near that movie theater.

10:25.180 --> 10:26.180
Dammit.

10:26.180 --> 10:27.020
Where is it?

10:28.850 --> 10:30.150
Where are you, Aoshi?

10:31.230 --> 10:34.610
I have to find you soon or Sasame will...

10:40.990 --> 10:42.030
Sasame, I...

10:43.410 --> 10:47.160
I don't want to lose you, Sasame!

10:49.790 --> 10:51.710
Where are you?

10:51.710 --> 10:53.880
Answer me, Aoshi!

10:59.470 --> 11:00.550
Akashi...

11:00.550 --> 11:02.010
Aoshi...

11:02.010 --> 11:02.760
Is it this way?

11:06.310 --> 11:07.520
Found it!

11:10.850 --> 11:11.730
That's...

11:24.280 --> 11:27.870
This is where we all played together in the past...

11:39.840 --> 11:41.180
There you are.

11:41.180 --> 11:44.640
So you were here of all places, Aoshi.

12:03.200 --> 12:04.450
How's it going?

12:04.450 --> 12:05.820
Are you scared?

12:05.820 --> 12:08.120
If you're scared, you can cry.

12:08.490 --> 12:11.620
Crybaby Minashi and spoiled little Sasame.

12:11.620 --> 12:14.710
Neither of you could do anything without me.

12:15.080 --> 12:16.380
Oh...

12:16.380 --> 12:17.670
That's how it used to be.

12:18.800 --> 12:20.130
Sasame...

12:20.380 --> 12:22.340
Could you imagine it?

12:22.340 --> 12:26.890
All the things I had to go through after you betrayed me.

12:27.550 --> 12:30.270
Hey, can you image it?

12:30.270 --> 12:34.140
The fear of having no one reply,
no matter how much you called out.

12:42.190 --> 12:44.360
Sasame, Minashi...

12:44.360 --> 12:45.780
Let's all go back together.

12:46.070 --> 12:49.540
Akashi-kun and the others want to leave.

12:49.540 --> 12:50.740
Sasame!

12:52.160 --> 12:53.750
Akashi-kun!

12:53.750 --> 12:55.290
Everyone else, come here!

12:55.290 --> 12:56.630
Sasame!

12:57.250 --> 12:58.790
But why?

12:58.790 --> 13:01.210
Everyone, don't go...

13:01.210 --> 13:02.460
Why?

13:03.010 --> 13:06.510
Akashi promised he'd be with me forever.

13:07.510 --> 13:10.060
Why are you taking him?

13:10.060 --> 13:14.600
We were told that we can't leave
this area, so why are you leaving?

13:15.310 --> 13:17.600
Sasame, answer me!

13:17.600 --> 13:19.060
Why?

13:19.060 --> 13:21.150
I don't want to be alone,

13:21.150 --> 13:22.360
Sasame...

13:26.610 --> 13:29.660
You'll come back, right, Sasame?

13:29.660 --> 13:31.040
Minashi?

13:31.660 --> 13:34.160
You'll come back together with Akashi?

13:36.870 --> 13:38.040
Sasame...

13:39.080 --> 13:40.790
So that's how it is.

13:40.790 --> 13:44.630
I was betrayed by my younger sister.

13:46.010 --> 13:47.430
Give him back...

13:48.390 --> 13:50.430
Give Akashi back to me.

13:51.890 --> 13:53.350
I know...

13:53.350 --> 13:55.890
I should go pick him up instead.

13:55.890 --> 13:59.350
Since Akashi must feel that he wants to be with me.

14:00.610 --> 14:02.610
I'll bring everyone else too.

14:03.690 --> 14:06.820
I'll have everyone receive the proper punishment.

14:07.740 --> 14:09.320
Let's go, Corpse.

14:11.620 --> 14:14.120
But I was truly shocked.

14:14.750 --> 14:16.750
Seeing Akashi's eyes that time...

14:17.460 --> 14:21.380
They gave me a clear signal when they looked at me.

14:22.290 --> 14:26.260
It showed me that was I no longer inside his heart.

14:27.590 --> 14:29.890
Do you understand now, Sasame?

14:29.890 --> 14:31.550
About how I felt right then?

14:32.680 --> 14:35.520
Because you whisked him away from me,

14:35.520 --> 14:38.940
I was erased from Akashi's memories!

14:39.560 --> 14:40.900
Hold on, Tsugumi, that's not how it is!

14:42.650 --> 14:44.440
The same goes for you, Minashi!

14:46.070 --> 14:48.150
You guys are the ones in the wrong.

14:49.320 --> 14:52.160
So why am I the only one going through all this?

15:03.960 --> 15:06.760
I won't let you take Akashi away again.

15:07.170 --> 15:10.050
I'll never give him to Sasame.

15:11.890 --> 15:14.680
Aoshi, I need your help.

15:15.970 --> 15:18.100
Why things turned out this way...

15:18.100 --> 15:19.690
What I should do and how...

15:20.850 --> 15:23.650
My mind's all messed up, and I just don't understand.

15:24.980 --> 15:27.320
I don't know if there's anything I can do.

15:28.900 --> 15:32.410
But this is something I can say for certain:

15:33.280 --> 15:35.490
Even if she's a LIM, no matter what happens...

15:37.040 --> 15:39.370
I don't want to lose Sasame!

15:58.850 --> 16:00.520
What is this sin?

16:01.390 --> 16:03.150
Everyone abandoned me.

16:04.860 --> 16:07.650
You are the children of sin.

16:14.820 --> 16:17.700
If that's a sin, then I'm part of it.

16:18.700 --> 16:19.950
It's all right.

16:19.950 --> 16:20.950
I'll be with you.

16:21.410 --> 16:22.960
I'll always be with you.

16:23.710 --> 16:25.500
How can I atone for my sin?

16:26.040 --> 16:27.710
What do you wish for?

16:28.500 --> 16:32.670
But is that what you truly want, Tsugumi?

16:38.470 --> 16:39.850
Stop it already!

16:57.780 --> 17:00.160
It's a sad sight to see, Corpse.

17:00.160 --> 17:01.750
But there's no helping it.

17:06.330 --> 17:08.090
I don't want it like this...

17:08.840 --> 17:12.840
Emiru and Sasame have suffered plenty already,
and yet it's still not enough?

17:13.260 --> 17:15.300
Keep Mahmu out of this!

17:17.470 --> 17:22.100
I need to end this fast so I can go look for Akashi.

17:24.730 --> 17:25.690
Akashi-kun?

17:26.140 --> 17:30.320
Is that really Akashi? With such a strong link?

17:31.280 --> 17:32.820
Akashi is coming?

17:48.170 --> 17:50.920
Why does the machine feel so light?

17:51.500 --> 17:53.550
It feels almost lighter than my arms and legs.

18:05.890 --> 18:06.850
Akashi?

18:06.850 --> 18:08.600
I can feel his presence, for sure.

18:08.600 --> 18:09.940
Me too.

18:09.940 --> 18:11.730
He's probably in combat.

18:12.570 --> 18:14.780
We'd just get in his way if we approached haphazardly.

18:34.130 --> 18:35.260
This is the end for you!

18:37.800 --> 18:39.090
Stop it, Akashi!

18:39.760 --> 18:41.800
The Corpse is giving out the just punishment.

18:43.890 --> 18:45.270
Will that <i>really</i> make it go away?

18:46.930 --> 18:50.400
The solitude you've harbored for these past 10 years.

18:51.480 --> 18:53.400
You were unable to touch anyone,

18:53.860 --> 18:55.860
and no one was able to recognize you.

18:56.610 --> 18:58.320
And as the loneliness continued to drift in,

18:59.030 --> 19:03.410
perhaps you lost sight of those who saw you who you were?

19:04.870 --> 19:06.910
The past won't go away.

19:06.910 --> 19:09.870
Even if you do things like this,
the things that hurt you won't—

19:09.870 --> 19:11.710
Don't give me arbitrary thoughts!

19:13.000 --> 19:14.130
Tsugumi...

19:14.130 --> 19:16.090
Then tell me, how will it go away?

19:16.340 --> 19:17.710
Tell me!

19:18.380 --> 19:21.800
You don't even have an answer yourself,
so don't say random things.

19:22.390 --> 19:23.680
Let's go back together!

19:26.890 --> 19:30.690
Getting out of here together, with Akashi?

19:32.770 --> 19:34.360
That's right.

19:34.360 --> 19:35.900
Let's leave this place together.

19:36.400 --> 19:37.610
I can't...

19:37.610 --> 19:39.950
I can't leave this place.

19:39.950 --> 19:41.030
Why?

19:41.030 --> 19:42.950
You shouldn't even stuck in a place like this.

19:42.950 --> 19:44.320
Akashi...

19:44.320 --> 19:46.790
I'm sure Sasame wishes for that as well.

19:48.290 --> 19:48.870
Sasame...

19:55.710 --> 19:56.290
Tsugumi!

20:03.510 --> 20:05.140
Akashi, you shouldn't.

20:07.390 --> 20:08.310
Let's go back.

20:15.520 --> 20:16.480
They're coming!

20:16.480 --> 20:17.690
They're coming back!

20:17.690 --> 20:19.860
Akashi, Minashi, and Mahmu too!

20:23.990 --> 20:26.160
We have established communication with the Argent!

20:26.160 --> 20:27.660
Akashi, are you okay?

20:27.660 --> 20:28.620
Yes.

20:28.620 --> 20:29.870
All six of us are fine.

20:29.870 --> 20:31.080
I'm so glad.

20:33.370 --> 20:35.170
The resonance rate...

20:35.170 --> 20:37.790
It's over the theoretical limit?

20:39.630 --> 20:40.880
I see...

20:40.880 --> 20:43.050
So we all knew each other in the past.

20:43.970 --> 20:45.550
It was revenge.

20:47.140 --> 20:53.390
If only we had met all of you before we created the Lightless Realm...

20:59.520 --> 21:00.900
It's withered...

21:01.230 --> 21:03.490
Akashi, what's that?

21:03.900 --> 21:06.030
This is Arbornine fruit.

21:06.030 --> 21:09.200
There are a lot of them growing in the Lightless Realm.

21:09.660 --> 21:13.660
With this, you can bypass the
effects of the Lightless Realm.

21:14.330 --> 21:17.920
This is the sole reason Tsugumi has been fine all this time.

21:20.420 --> 21:21.670
Arbornine...

21:21.670 --> 21:22.880
But...

21:22.880 --> 21:26.590
It most likely can only live within the Lightless Realm.

21:36.560 --> 21:39.520
Sasame, I wonder if you're listening.

21:40.440 --> 21:42.900
Today, I got linked to my brother.

21:44.110 --> 21:47.070
I got linked when I didn't know what to do,

21:47.070 --> 21:49.820
but I still thought I wanted to do something.

21:50.910 --> 21:53.870
Maybe it's due to how he felt when he became a LIM.

21:54.960 --> 21:56.620
Is it the same for you, Sasame?

21:58.670 --> 22:03.590
It's thanks to you that I'm
able to feel this way, Sasame.

22:05.420 --> 22:07.930
Because I still have the warmth from that day.

22:13.680 --> 22:16.690
I finally figured something out.

22:16.690 --> 22:20.770
Even if you're a LIM, and you think of someone else...

22:21.730 --> 22:24.360
I don't want to lose you.

22:25.440 --> 22:30.320
I'm in love with you, Sasame.

22:56.350 --> 23:00.400
You lose your mind, you crash; a nervous breakdown

23:00.400 --> 23:05.150
You feel an urge inside, you crush; there's no escape now

23:05.150 --> 23:10.030
You try to change your life, you jump another let down

23:10.030 --> 23:12.620
But then you hear a voice inside

23:12.620 --> 23:15.910
You gotta open up your vision and see the life bestowed on you

23:15.910 --> 23:18.500
Blinded by reality

23:18.500 --> 23:20.670
Broken ideology

23:20.670 --> 23:23.210
Heart in captivity

23:23.210 --> 23:25.550
Hold on, exceeding the borders within

23:25.550 --> 23:28.050
Seize your capability

23:28.050 --> 23:30.430
Endless possibility

23:30.430 --> 23:32.760
Find your individuality

23:32.840 --> 23:34.970
Take pride; let the chase begin

23:34.970 --> 23:37.640
Don't tell me what direction you think I should take

23:37.640 --> 23:39.430
I know now to find the way

23:39.430 --> 23:42.440
Don’t tell me that this sable is for my own sake

23:42.440 --> 23:43.980
Here's what I’ve got to say

23:43.980 --> 23:47.230
Don't tell me to believe the decisions you make

23:47.230 --> 23:49.440
Facing a new day

23:49.440 --> 23:51.450
So open up your blinded eyes

23:51.450 --> 23:54.450
Stop living a lie and start living your life

23:54.450 --> 23:56.790
My way or no way

23:56.790 --> 23:59.250
Today you’re falling away

23:59.250 --> 24:01.580
My way or no way

24:01.580 --> 24:04.880
Today I’m breaking away

24:05.000 --> 24:10.010
Episode 18

24:05.000 --> 24:10.010
The Truth of Yomijima
